#*#

# ==========================
# 3. Python (For your solve scripts)
# ==========================
# Byte-compiled / optimized / DLL files
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# Virtual Environments (Very Important to ignore)
venv/
env/
.env
.venv/
ENV/

# Distribution / Packaging
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
eggs/
lib/
lib64/
*.egg-info/

# Jupyter Notebooks (Checkpoint files)
.ipynb_checkpoints

# ==========================
# 4. CTF & Forensics Evidence (HUGE FILES)
# ==========================
# Packet Captures (The one you had issues with)
*.pcap
*.pcapng
*.cap

# Disk Images & Memory Dumps
*.iso
*.img
*.vmem
*.dmp
*.vmdk
*.ova

# Database files
*.db
*.sqlite3

# Large Archives (Optional: Comment out if you WANT to push zips)
# It is safer to ignore them by default so you don't push a 2GB zip.
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.rar
*.7z

# Specific folder for heavy evidence
# Create a folder named "evidence" or "raw" and put your big files there.
evidence/
raw_files/
downloads/

# ==========================
# 5. MkDocs (Website Generator)
# ==========================
# The actual built website (You only push the source, not the build)
site/

# ==========================
# 6. Sensitive Data (Security)
# ==========================
# Never push keys, secrets, or logs
*.log
.env
secret.txt
keys.txt
config.py